{
  "total": 89.142,
  "lines": [
    {
      "key": "h1",
      "text": "Meta rebuilt the system that decides which ads people see.",
      "start": 0.4,
      "end": 3.897
    },
    {
      "key": "h2",
      "text": "Here's what changed.",
      "start": 4.097,
      "end": 5.233
    },
    {
      "key": "w1",
      "text": "Every time someone scrolls, there are tens of millions of ads Meta could show.",
      "start": 5.733,
      "end": 10.389
    },
    {
      "key": "w2",
      "text": "Andromeda is step one.",
      "start": 10.639,
      "end": 12.166
    },
    {
      "key": "w3",
      "text": "It cuts them down to a few thousand,",
      "start": 12.366,
      "end": 14.259
    },
    {
      "key": "w4",
      "text": "then ranking and the auction pick the winner.",
      "start": 14.359,
      "end": 16.741
    },
    {
      "key": "u1",
      "text": "On October 28th, Meta released the next generation.",
      "start": 17.241,
      "end": 20.85
    },
    {
      "key": "u2",
      "text": "It checks over a billion ads a second,",
      "start": 21.1,
      "end": 23.08
    },
    {
      "key": "u3",
      "text": "with 300 times less compute than the 2024 version.",
      "start": 23.18,
      "end": 27.184
    },
    {
      "key": "c1",
      "text": "The big change is how it reads people.",
      "start": 27.684,
      "end": 29.838
    },
    {
      "key": "c2",
      "text": "The old version had one model for everyone.",
      "start": 30.088,
      "end": 32.788
    },
    {
      "key": "c3",
      "text": "The new one uses a team of specialists, each reading a different signal.",
      "start": 33.038,
      "end": 37.208
    },
    {
      "key": "s1",
      "text": "Recent engagement.",
      "start": 37.458,
      "end": 38.654
    },
    {
      "key": "s2",
      "text": "The groups you belong to.",
      "start": 38.854,
      "end": 40.179
    },
    {
      "key": "s3",
      "text": "What an ad actually means.",
      "start": 40.379,
      "end": 42.025
    },
    {
      "key": "s4",
      "text": "And activity across Facebook and Instagram.",
      "start": 42.225,
      "end": 44.842
    },
    {
      "key": "r1",
      "text": "Meta says it's lifted Facebook conversions by 2.4% since 2025.",
      "start": 45.342,
      "end": 51.255
    },
    {
      "key": "m1",
      "text": "For advertisers, the creative now does the targeting.",
      "start": 51.755,
      "end": 55.12
    },
    {
      "key": "m2",
      "text": "Andromeda reads your ad to decide who sees it.",
      "start": 55.37,
      "end": 58.14
    },
    {
      "key": "m3",
      "text": "So ten ads with the same visual and a new headline count as one.",
      "start": 58.39,
      "end": 62.586
    },
    {
      "key": "d1",
      "text": "Ads Manager now shows this.",
      "start": 63.486,
      "end": 65.286
    },
    {
      "key": "d2",
      "text": "Since August, every ad set gets a creative diversity rating.",
      "start": 65.486,
      "end": 69.466
    },
    {
      "key": "d3",
      "text": "Low, medium or high.",
      "start": 69.666,
      "end": 70.936
    },
    {
      "key": "a1",
      "text": "At Adwave, we build for exactly this.",
      "start": 71.536,
      "end": 74.126
    },
    {
      "key": "a2",
      "text": "Creative across different angles,",
      "start": 74.376,
      "end": 76.295
    },
    {
      "key": "a3",
      "text": "ideal customers,",
      "start": 76.395,
      "end": 77.568
    },
    {
      "key": "a4",
      "text": "awareness levels",
      "start": 77.668,
      "end": 78.708
    },
    {
      "key": "a5",
      "text": "and formats.",
      "start": 78.808,
      "end": 79.708
    },
    {
      "key": "a6",
      "text": "Then we measure what performs,",
      "start": 80.058,
      "end": 81.606
    },
    {
      "key": "a7",
      "text": "cut what doesn't,",
      "start": 81.756,
      "end": 82.713
    },
    {
      "key": "a8",
      "text": "and iterate.",
      "start": 82.863,
      "end": 83.692
    },
    {
      "key": "e1",
      "text": "Check your rating today.",
      "start": 84.192,
      "end": 85.521
    },
    {
      "key": "e2",
      "text": "If it's low, talk to Adwave.",
      "start": 85.721,
      "end": 87.542
    }
  ]
}